engine mcl_core 8.1.3 (UNMODIFIED): BURNIN=10000 DECIMATION=2
parameters: word-bits=32 table=2^16 x 32 bit key-bits=256 out-bytes=40 burnin=10000
            sha-T=228992 sha-Tdepth=70400 clifford-gate-factor=1 clifford-depth-factor=1
